<title>SPAIN: Spain Oct M4 rose provisional 12.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain Oct M4 rose provisional 12.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following provisional figures:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		    OCT 96     SEPT 96     OCT 95</p>
<p> M4 pct rise			12.4	  9.3	  6.2</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise	2.1	 12.6	  4.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis. Revised figures for previous months will follow later.</p>
</text>
